      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This bug appears to still be present! Using latest VCC as of May 26 2023, VRC World SDK 3.2.0. The example program here loops forever. It should print 0 to 9, then print done, then print 10.\n\nThe while condition never updates. If its false to start with, it goes to Exit immediately. If its true to start with, the loop runs forever.\n\nI also attached the udon assembly with addresses marked for each instruction. The \"JUMP, 0x00000034\" at the end of the body jumps to the wrong address; it should jump to 0x14",
